Data about weight, Temperature, pH, Hardness, Conductivity, and Flow have "0" that shall be NA.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
data_renamed <- data_renamed |>
  mutate(
    across(
      c(
        Weight_g,
        Temperature_C,
        pH,
        Hardness,
        Conductivity,
        Flow
      ),
      ~ na_if(.x, 0)
    )
  )
```
